  <description type="1">
   <narrative xml:lang="SV">Aims to diminish need for inst. of children. Direct objective to implement new methods of social work with children and children at risk. Builds upon positive exp in previous project with Zenit Int and Judet of Orhei, follow-up is incl and 2 new Jud. Seminars, study-trip to Swe</narrative>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">M&#xe5;l att minska behovet av barn p&#xe5; inst p&#xe5; l&#xe4;ngre sikt. Fr&#xe4;mjar implemeav nya arbetsmetoder f&#xf6;r barn och utsatta barn. Bygger p&#xe5; tidigare promed Zenit Int och regionen Orhei. Uppf&#xf6;ljning, seminarier samt stud. bes&#xf6;k till Sverige ing&#xe5;r. Ytterligare tv&#xe5; judet ing&#xe5;r.</narrative>
  </description>
